{"seq":3,"slug":"ideas-and-methods","title":"保罗·格雷厄姆·思想与方法","stage":"DONE","category":"paul-graham","categoryLabel":"保罗·格雷厄姆","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/ideas-and-methods","rating":{"composite":3.78,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/08_paul-graham/3_ideas-and-methods","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"思想与方法\">思想与方法</h1><p>本卷剖析保罗·格雷厄姆作为思想家的核心观念与工作方法——不是他做了什么（那属于生平与贡献），而是<strong>他如何看待创造、思考、写作与财富</strong>，以及这些观念背后那条统一的逻辑链。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一条贯穿全卷的主线\">一条贯穿全卷的主线</h2><p>格雷厄姆的思想看似分散在编程、写作、创业三个领域，实则由一条价值主线串起——<strong>创造高于一切</strong>：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    H[&quot;黑客即创造者&lt;br/&gt;创造高于一切&quot;] --&gt; I[&quot;独立思考&lt;br/&gt;创造的发动机&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; W[&quot;写作即思考&lt;br/&gt;厘清与保护思想&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; T[&quot;创造者的时间表&lt;br/&gt;创造需要整块时间&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; WE[&quot;创造而非攫取&lt;br/&gt;财富=做出别人想要的东西&quot;]&#10;    WE --&gt; F[&quot;创业者成功之道&lt;br/&gt;决心·专注·快速学习&quot;]&#10;    W -.同构.-&gt; H\">flowchart LR\n    H[\"黑客即创造者&lt;br/&gt;创造高于一切\"] --&gt; I[\"独立思考&lt;br/&gt;创造的发动机\"]\n    I --&gt; W[\"写作即思考&lt;br/&gt;厘清与保护思想\"]\n    H --&gt; T[\"创造者的时间表&lt;br/&gt;创造需要整块时间\"]\n    I --&gt; WE[\"创造而非攫取&lt;br/&gt;财富=做出别人想要的东西\"]\n    WE --&gt; F[\"创业者成功之道&lt;br/&gt;决心·专注·快速学习\"]\n    W -.同构.-&gt; H</pre><p>读懂这条链，本卷的六篇文章就不再是孤立的&quot;金句&quot;,而是同一世界观的不同侧面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷三章与各篇分工\">本卷三章与各篇分工</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章</th>\n<th>篇</th>\n<th>一句话主旨</th>\n<th>关键来源（年份）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一·创造者的心态</td>\n<td><a href=\"the-maker-mindset/makers-schedule\">创造者的时间表</a></td>\n<td>创造者以半天为时间单位，中断的代价是非线性的</td>\n<td>Maker&#39;s Schedule (2009)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一·创造者的心态</td>\n<td><a href=\"the-maker-mindset/hacking-and-creativity\">黑客精神与创造</a></td>\n<td>顶尖程序员是与画家同类的创造者</td>\n<td>Hackers and Painters (2003)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二·思考与写作</td>\n<td><a href=\"thinking-and-writing/writing-is-thinking\">写作即思考</a></td>\n<td>写不清楚=没想清楚；写作是发现而非记录</td>\n<td>Putting Ideas Into Words (2022)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二·思考与写作</td>\n<td><a href=\"thinking-and-writing/independent-thinking\">独立思考</a></td>\n<td>进取的独立者最稀少，却贡献全部原创突破</td>\n<td>The Four Quadrants of Conformism (2020)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三·创业与财富</td>\n<td><a href=\"startups-and-wealth/how-to-create-wealth\">如何创造财富</a></td>\n<td>财富≠金钱；致富靠创造（正和）而非攫取（零和）</td>\n<td>How to Make Wealth (2004)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>三·创业与财富</td>\n<td><a href=\"startups-and-wealth/what-makes-founders-succeed\">创业者成功之道</a></td>\n<td>决心&gt;智力；专注用户+快速学习</td>\n<td>What We Look for in Founders (2009)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>保罗·格雷厄姆系列共六卷，请勿混淆各卷职责：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>本卷（思想与方法）</strong> 只讲<strong>观念与方法论</strong>——他怎么想、为什么这么想。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a> 讲<strong>事实与年表</strong>：早年与 Lisp、Viaweb 卖给雅虎、<a href=\"../life-and-times/y-combinator-years/\">Y Combinator 岁月</a>。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a> 讲他<strong>制度化的成果</strong>：<a href=\"../core-contributions/y-combinator-model/\">YC 模式</a>、<a href=\"../core-contributions/startup-philosophy/\">创业哲学</a>——即本卷思想落地为机构的部分。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../major-works/\">主要作品</a> 讲<strong>文本本身</strong>：<a href=\"../major-works/hackers-and-painters/\">《黑客与画家》</a>、<a href=\"../major-works/the-essays/\">随笔集</a>——本卷讨论思想，该卷讨论承载思想的作品。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a>、<a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a> 讲<strong>他人如何接受与批评</strong>这些思想。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>简言之：<strong>本卷=观念，作品卷=文本，贡献卷=机构，生平卷=年表</strong>。同一事实（如 YC、《黑客与画家》）只在其主篇展开，本卷以相对链接指向，不重复叙述。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>前置</strong>：无硬性前置；若对其生平陌生，可先快速浏览 <a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a> 建立背景。</li>\n<li><strong>最佳顺序</strong>：先读 <a href=\"the-maker-mindset/hacking-and-creativity\">黑客精神与创造</a> 把握&quot;创造高于一切&quot;的总纲 → 再读 <a href=\"thinking-and-writing/independent-thinking\">独立思考</a> 与 <a href=\"thinking-and-writing/writing-is-thinking\">写作即思考</a> 理解其思维方法 → 最后读 <a href=\"startups-and-wealth/how-to-create-wealth\">如何创造财富</a> 与 <a href=\"startups-and-wealth/what-makes-founders-succeed\">创业者成功之道</a>，看这套世界观如何落到创业与财富。</li>\n<li><strong>若只读一篇</strong>：读 <a href=\"the-maker-mindset/hacking-and-creativity\">黑客精神与创造</a>——它是理解其余五篇的钥匙。</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>本卷所引观点均来自格雷厄姆公开发表的随笔（paulgraham.com），各篇内已逐一标注篇名、年份与链接，可自行核验。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-maker-mindset","title":"创造者的心态","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/ideas-and-methods/the-maker-mindset","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"makers-schedule","title":"创造者的时间表","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/ideas-and-methods/the-maker-mindset/makers-schedule"},{"seq":2,"slug":"hacking-and-creativity","title":"黑客精神与创造","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/ideas-and-methods/the-maker-mindset/hacking-and-creativity"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"thinking-and-writing","title":"思考与写作","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/ideas-and-methods/thinking-and-writing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"writing-is-thinking","title":"写作即思考","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/ideas-and-methods/thinking-and-writing/writing-is-thinking"},{"seq":2,"slug":"independent-thinking","title":"独立思考","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/ideas-and-methods/thinking-and-writing/independent-thinking"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"startups-and-wealth","title":"创业与财富","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/ideas-and-methods/startups-and-wealth","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"how-to-create-wealth","title":"如何创造财富","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/ideas-and-methods/startups-and-wealth/how-to-create-wealth"},{"seq":2,"slug":"what-makes-founders-succeed","title":"创业者成功之道","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/paul-graham/ideas-and-methods/startups-and-wealth/what-makes-founders-succeed"}]}]}